   "text": "POST /api/chat/stream\n{ conversation_id, message, document_ids[] }\n← text/event-stream\n  event: intent    {ask|summary|draft|clarify}\n  event: token     {text}\n  event: citation  {source, doc_id, page, section, quote}\n  event: done      {message_id}\n  event: error     {code, message, request_id}",
