   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "CORS: localhost only  ·  Request-ID on every call\nPydantic request / response validation\nerror envelope  { code, message, request_id }\nstructured JSON logs + per-step timings\nupload limits:  ≤ 25 MB  ·  ≤ 300 pages  ·  PDF / DOCX\nGET /api/health  →  SQLite · model runtime · indexes",
   "originalText": "CORS: localhost only  ·  Request-ID on every call\nPydantic request / response validation\nerror envelope  { code, message, request_id }\nstructured JSON logs + per-step timings\nupload limits:  ≤ 25 MB  ·  ≤ 300 pages  ·  PDF / DOCX\nGET /api/health  →  SQLite · model runtime · indexes",
