   "text": "ConversationService     ·     ChatService  (calls orchestration, relays SSE)     ·     DocumentService  (validate, save file, enqueue ingestion)\nTransactionLogger  —  every user action (upload, ask, rename, delete …) is written to the transactions table with its request_id and latency",
   "originalText": "ConversationService     ·     ChatService  (calls orchestration, relays SSE)     ·     DocumentService  (validate, save file, enqueue ingestion)\nTransactionLogger  —  every user action (upload, ask, rename, delete …) is written to the transactions table with its request_id and latency",
