   "text": "Chat LLM — one model, several prompts:\n    intent router · query editor · answer · summary · draft\nEmbedding model — ingestion + queries\nCross-encoder re-ranker  (in-process)\nOCR + layout models  (in-process)\nbound to 127.0.0.1  ·  no outbound network calls",
